Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|custom.properties|default.layout.template.id=1_column|
		|osgi.app.includes|my-subscriptions|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|plugins.deployment.type|osgi|
		|testray.main.component.name|My Subscriptions|
		|test.assert.warning.exceptions|true|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|My Subscriptions Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|My Subscriptions Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|My Subscriptions|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Subscribe And Unsubscribeto Bookmarks Root Folder
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Bookmarks Page|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Bookmarks Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Bookmarks|
	And Subscriptions subscribe Via Info Panel PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|My Subscriptions Page|
	And Subscriptions view Subscription
		|assetName|Bookmarks Folder|
		|assetTitle|Home|
		|assetType|Bookmarks Folder|
	And Subscriptions unsubscribe Via My Subscriptions
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|My Subscriptions Page|
	And Subscriptions view Default PG
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Bookmarks Page|
	Then Subscriptions view Unsubscribed Via Info Panel